#, php-format
msgid "WooCommerce keeps a fast SKU index alongside your products. %s entry in it points at a product that was deleted. The WordPress admin will tell you that SKU is free, but the REST API refuses to create a product with it, so ERP, import and sync integrations fail with \"already present in the lookup table\"."
