#: front-end/currency/brikpanel-currency-settings.php:117
msgid "When your store takes orders in more than one currency, BrikPanel converts every order to your store currency before adding it up, so Revenue, Average Order Value and the sales chart are never a meaningless mix of currencies. If you use a multi-currency plugin such as CURCY, the exact rate from the day of each sale is read automatically from the order; you only need the rates below for currencies that arrive without one."
